#==============================================================================================
#
#   easing_style_value - EasingStyleValue: linear(), cubic-bezier() and steps()
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/StyleValues/EasingStyleValue.cpp (lines 1-131) and the inline members
#       of EasingStyleValue.h: each easing function's serialization and computational
#       independence, and the style value's absolutization. The structs' defaulted operator==
#       are the css_easing_*_equal helpers (CubicBezier's own operator== ignores its sample cache).
